# Everything reprepro writes. The repository is rebuilt from scratch on every site deploy, from
# the .deb on every published release, so none of it is a source file and none of it is committed
# — see "The apt repository" in docs/DEPLOYMENT.md for why that was chosen over committing the
# pool back to main.
#
# conf/distributions is the exception, and is tracked: it is the only part a person writes.
dists/
pool/
db/
lists/
key.asc
